==Trivia==
*Apmeken's gender was changed to female with the release of the [[Lores and Histories]] text {{RSL|Tumeken's Dream}} in 2008. This was also changed in ''Old School RuneScape'' with the release of [[Beneath Cursed Sands]], although the [[Apparition#Apmeken|manifestation of Apmeken]] that appears during [[Icthlarin's Little Helper]] had, up until that update, always been referred to as having a 'body of a woman'.

